💡 Design Goals:

Clean, modern layout similar to PhonePe, Google Pay, or Paytm.

Easy input for mobile number and amount.

Secure, intuitive interface with confirmation and success feedback.

Responsive for desktop and mobile view.

🎨 Color Theme:

Primary: #003087 (Deep Blue)

Accent: #ffffff (White), #f2f2f2 (Light Gray), #00b894 (Success Green)

Font: Use Google Fonts like Inter or Roboto

📄 Page Sections:

Header:

Logo (top-left)

Title: "Pay to Mobile Number"

Optional: User icon or logout button (top-right)

Main Form Card (Centered Box):

Input: Mobile Number

Validation for 10-digit mobile format

Input: Amount

Numeric only

Dropdown (Optional): Select UPI App or Bank

Note Field (Optional): "Add a short note"

Pay Button (Full Width)

Confirmation Modal (on clicking Pay):

Show entered details

Confirm or Cancel

Success State UI:

Checkmark icon

Text: “Payment Successful”

Transaction ID / Timestamp

Button: "Make Another Payment"

Footer:

Privacy, Terms, Support links

⚙️ JavaScript Features:

Mobile number and amount validation

Show/hide confirmation modal

Animate success state

Optionally store recent numbers in localStorage

📱 Responsive Design:

Flexbox/Grid layout

Mobile-first approach

Button tap-friendly sizing (min height: 44px)</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="_8Y0oDg k4j3Cg NKCS0g BMOCzQ fOwrSw"><div class="KlwwuQ aD_A0Q qfClSw BMOCzQ"><div class="_1_Pgpg BMOCzQ"><div><div class="jv_R6g" style="--NZu1Zw: 12px;"><div class="jv_R6g" style="--NZu1Zw: 8px;"><p class="aWBg0w aZskFA u16U_g mKhvSg"><div>Oh no! Something went wrong on my side of things. Try asking me again.</div></p></div></div></div><div class="G6YLJA BMOCzQ ESGcVw GsIi1Q rXzsBA EC2pjw" role="group" aria-label="Provide feedback" style="--gms-pw: 4px;"><div class="IZ4ahw"><div class="lJVQMg" style="--dVJz5A: 4px; --WF3kKw: center;"><div class="eAUiHA"><div class="FJA3UA"><button class="_5KtATA LQzFZw VgvqkQ _8ERLTg h69Neg unS_Qw LQzFZw VgvqkQ f5yKmw xdqtjA j34Zww aqbYPg _3FvZZg gi5pqg" type="button" aria-label="Good response" role="radio" aria-checked="false"><span class="vxQy1w"><span aria-hidden="true" class="uRWxVA dkWypw"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M9.7 3.88c.33-.5.92-.95 1.82-.95.97 0 1.55.63 1.84 1.11a3.38 3.38 0 0 1 .38.95l.02.05a24.7 24.7 0 0 0 .93 2.55c.06.14.3.44.7.87a62.84 62.84 0 0 0 2.9 2.72h1.73v8.5h-1.98l-3.5.25H8.5a2.88 2.88 0 0 1-.13.01c-.11.01-.26.02-.43.01a1.8 1.8 0 0 1-1.2-.5c-.3-.29-.49-.6-.6-.9-.29-.1-.6-.3-.9-.6-.44-.42-.47-1-.43-1.37.01-.13.03-.25.06-.37-.1-.09-.21-.2-.3-.32a2.3 2.3 0 0 1-.55-1.46c0-.63.33-1.14.6-1.46a2.3 2.3 0 0 1-.61-1.54c0-.3.07-.6.23-.85.16-.27.39-.43.61-.52.35-.14.74-.13.88-.13a2 2 0 0 0 .04 0h4.2c-.56-1.88-.7-3.87-.7-4.75 0-.31.11-.83.42-1.3zm7.83 8.62-.01-.01-.03-.03-.12-.1a65.58 65.58 0 0 1-3.06-2.87 6.06 6.06 0 0 1-.97-1.23 15.25 15.25 0 0 1-.96-2.57l-.06-.22-.02-.06v-.02l.72-.21-.73.2v-.05l-.02-.03a1.8 1.8 0 0 0-.2-.48c-.15-.27-.33-.4-.55-.4-.31 0-.47.14-.58.3-.07.1-.11.2-.14.3-.03.09-.03.15-.03.16 0 .95.2 3.34.94 5.22l.41 1.03H5.7a7.21 7.21 0 0 0-.18 0c0 .18.07.35.2.51.14.17.3.28.38.32l1.13.56-1.03.72a1.67 1.67 0 0 0-.11.09c