💡 Design Goals:

Clean, modern layout similar to PhonePe, Google Pay, or Paytm.

Easy input for mobile number and amount.

Secure, intuitive interface with confirmation and success feedback.

Responsive for desktop and mobile view.

🎨 Color Theme:

Primary: #003087 (Deep Blue)

Accent: #ffffff (White), #f2f2f2 (Light Gray), #00b894 (Success Green)

Font: Use Google Fonts like Inter or Roboto

📄 Page Sections:

Header:

Logo (top-left)

Title: "Pay to Mobile Number"

Optional: User icon or logout button (top-right)

Main Form Card (Centered Box):

Input: Mobile Number

Validation for 10-digit mobile format

Input: Amount

Numeric only

Dropdown (Optional): Select UPI App or Bank

Note Field (Optional): "Add a short note"

Pay Button (Full Width)

Confirmation Modal (on clicking Pay):

Show entered details

Confirm or Cancel

Success State UI:

Checkmark icon

Text: “Payment Successful”

Transaction ID / Timestamp

Button: "Make Another Payment"

Footer:

Privacy, Terms, Support links

⚙️ JavaScript Features:

Mobile number and amount validation

Show/hide confirmation modal

Animate success state

Optionally store recent numbers in localStorage

📱 Responsive Design:

Flexbox/Grid layout

Mobile-first approach

Button tap-friendly sizing (min height: 44px)

</p></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class="_8Y0oDg k4j3Cg NKCS0g BMOCzQ fOwrSw"><div class="KlwwuQ aD_A0Q qfClSw BMOCzQ"><div class="_1_Pgpg BMOCzQ"><div><div class="jv_R6g" style="--NZu1Zw: 16px;"><div class="jv_R6g" style="--NZu1Zw: 8px;"><p class="aWBg0w aZskFA u16U_g mKhvSg"><div>I'll create a clean, modern mobile payment interface with all the features you've requested.</div></p><p class="aWBg0w aZskFA u16U_g mKhvSg"><div>This payment interface has everything you requested! It features a clean, modern design with a deep blue primary color, mobile number and amount validation, a confirmation modal, and a success screen with transaction details. Try entering a 10-digit mobile number and amount to see the full payment flow in action.</div></p></div><button type="button" class="PuABGQ W20Omw BMOCzQ _4tv94w aysH_g EC2pjw _6Mu4Ow a1ZYkQ YnfReg vFBXLA" style="--s_rwAw: inline-flex; --TPsgaw: 12px; --Wk647Q: 8px; --jVIKfw: var(--OuCkCQ); --rAXYhQ: var(--OuCkCQ);"><p class="aWBg0w aZskFA u16U_g">Version 1</p><span aria-hidden="true" class="NA_Img dkWypw lmfTqA"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path fill="currentColor" d="m9.216 7.619 4.204 4.204a.25.25 0 0 1 0 .354l-4.204 4.204a.75.75 0 0 0 1.06 1.061l4.205-4.204a1.75 1.75 0 0 0 0-2.475l-4.204-4.205a.75.75 0 0 0-1.061 1.06"></path></svg></span></button></div></div><div class="G6YLJA BMOCzQ ESGcVw GsIi1Q rXzsBA EC2pjw" role="group" aria-label="Provide feedback" style="--gms-pw: 4px;"><div class="IZ4ahw"><div class="lJVQMg" style="--dVJz5A: 4px; --WF3kKw: center;"><div class="eAUiHA"><div class="FJA3UA"><button class="_5KtATA LQzFZw VgvqkQ _8ERLTg h69Neg unS_Qw LQzFZw VgvqkQ f5yKmw xdqtjA j34Zww aqbYPg _3FvZZg gi5pqg" type="button" aria-label="Create Doc"><span class="vxQy1w"><span aria-hidden="true" class="uRWxVA dkWypw"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="