 class="aWBg0w aZskFA u16U_g mKhvSg">Transfer to Bank Account | Secure. Fast. Reliable."

🎯 Objective:
Design a clean, professional, and responsive "Pay to Bank Account" web page with a modern user interface. The interface should mimic reliable fintech platforms like PhonePe, Google Pay, or Paytm, while using the signature color #003087 for branding.

🎨 Color Palette:

Primary: #003087 (Royal Blue)

Secondary: #ffffff (White), #f2f2f2 (Light Gray), #00b894 (Success Green)

Font: Inter, Poppins, or Roboto

📐 Page Structure:

🔝 Header:

Logo (left), Page title

Navigation menu (Home, Payments, History, Support)

Sign In/Out button

💳 Main Form Section:

Input Fields:

Account Holder Name

Bank Account Number (with re-entry confirmation)

IFSC Code (with auto-suggestion or validation)

Transfer Amount

Optional note

Dropdown: Select bank (optional)

"Pay Now" button (full-width, hover effect)

✅ Confirmation Popup:

Show transfer details and ask for confirmation

Success animation upon confirmation

🔒 Security Highlight:

“100% secure transactions – end-to-end encrypted” section with icon

📱 Responsive Design:

Mobile-friendly form layout

Sticky CTA on mobile

⚙️ JS Interactivity:

Input validation (numeric, IFSC pattern)

Success toast/modal with animation

LocalStorage for recent beneficiaries (optional)

🔗 Footer:

